# Hall of Echoes' "{5}: This land becomes a copy of target creature you control until end of turn. The "legend rule"
# doesn't apply to permanents you control this turn" with its one target gone: Bot1 casts the Ornithopter it drew and aims
# the Hall at it on turn 3 and Bot2 bolts the Ornithopter in response. The ability does nothing at all (CR 608.2b) - the Hall stays a land, and
# the legend rule still applies: when Bot1 then casts a second Bofur, Reliable Guardian it keeps one of the two at once
# (CR 704.5j) and the other goes to the graveyard.

